  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 908.05 Stamping of Native Lumber. A sawmill selling native lumber may stamp such lumber, in addition to certifying the native lumber pursuant to Agr 908.04.\n\nSource. #6171, eff 1-24-96, EXPIRED: 1-24-04\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
